msgstr "Baca panduan pengguna %s"

#: includes/class-zinn-reseller-promo.php:314
msgid "Hide this"
msgstr "Sembunyikan ini"

#: includes/class-zinn-reseller-promo.php:424
msgid "Zinn® hosting for WordPress"
msgstr "Pengehosan Zinn® untuk WordPress"

#: includes/class-zinn-reseller-promo.php:425
msgid "LiteSpeed, daily backups, free migration and a control panel built for people who run more than one site."
msgstr "LiteSpeed, sandaran harian, migrasi percuma dan panel kawalan yang dibina untuk mereka yang mengendalikan lebih daripada satu tapak web."

#: includes/class-zinn-reseller-promo.php:431
msgid "The Zinn® marketplace"
msgstr "Pasaran Zinn®"

#: includes/class-zinn-reseller-promo.php:432
msgid "Buy and sell established sites, domains and link placements, with the money held safely until both sides are happy."
msgstr "Beli dan jual laman web yang mantap, domain dan penempatan pautan, dengan wang disimpan dengan selamat sehingga kedua-dua pihak berpuas hati."

#: includes/class-zinn-reseller-promo.php:479
msgid "Zinn Hub® — hire people who do this for a living"
msgstr "Zinn Hub® — upah orang yang melakukan perkara ini sebagai mata pencarian"

#: includes/class-zinn-reseller-promo.php:480
msgid "Our global freelance marketplace: browse over 10,000 ready-made services from writers, designers, developers and SEOs, or post a project and let them bid."
msgstr "Pasaran bebas global kami: layari lebih 10,000 perkhidmatan sedia ada daripada penulis, pereka, pembangun dan pakar SEO, atau siarkan projek dan biarkan mereka membida."

#: includes/class-zinn-reseller-style-presets.php:118
msgid "Style preset"
msgstr "Praset gaya"

#: includes/class-zinn-reseller-style-presets.php:119
msgid "A starting point. Anything below overrides it."
msgstr "Titik permulaan. Apa-apa sahaja di bawah membatalkannya."

#: includes/class-zinn-reseller-style-presets.php:126
msgid "Use my own colours and sizes"
msgstr "Gunakan warna dan saiz saya sendiri"

#: includes/class-zinn-reseller-style-presets.php:127
msgid "Leave this off and the preset is used exactly as it is."
msgstr "Biarkan ini dimatikan dan pratetap akan digunakan tepat seperti sedia ada."

#: includes/class-zinn-reseller-updater.php:253
msgid "See the Zinn Digital® release notes."
msgstr "Lihat nota keluaran Zinn Digital®."

#: includes/class-zinn-reseller-updater.php:302
msgid "The Zinn® update service did not issue a download link for this update. Check that this site can reach the Zinn® platform, then try again."
msgstr "Perkhidmatan kemas kini Zinn® tidak mengeluarkan pautan muat turun untuk kemas kini ini. Periksa sama ada tapak ini boleh mencapai platform Zinn®, kemudian cuba lagi."

#. translators: %s: the download error reported by WordPress.
#: includes/class-zinn-reseller-updater.php:316
#, php-format
msgid "The update could not be downloaded from the Zinn® update service (%s). Try again in a few minutes."
msgstr "Kemas kini tidak dapat dimuat turun daripada perkhidmatan kemas kini Zinn® (%s). Cuba lagi dalam beberapa minit."

#: includes/class-zinn-reseller-updater.php:330
msgid "The downloaded update failed its integrity check and was not installed."
msgstr "Kemas kini yang dimuat turun gagal dalam pemeriksaan integritinya dan tidak dipasang."

#: includes/mcp-kit/class-ability.php:94
msgid "The action could not be completed. Try again, and if it keeps failing, contact the site administrator."
msgstr "Tindakan tidak dapat diselesaikan. Sila cuba lagi, dan jika masalah masih berterusan, hubungi pentadbir tapak."

#: includes/mcp-kit/class-oauth.php:639
#: includes/mcp-kit/class-oauth.php:650
msgid "Connect an AI app"
msgstr "Sambungkan aplikasi AI"

#: includes/mcp-kit/class-oauth.php:652
#: includes/mcp-kit/class-oauth.php:658
#: includes/mcp-kit/class-oauth.php:699
msgid "This connection request has expired. Go back to the app and start connecting again."
msgstr "Permintaan sambungan ini telah tamat tempoh. Sila kembali ke aplikasi dan mulakan penyambungan semula."

#. translators: 1: the AI app's name, 2: the plugin's MCP server name, 3: the WordPress user's display name.
#: includes/mcp-kit/class-oauth.php:666
#, php-format
msgid "%1$s is asking to use %2$s on this site as %3$s. It can do only what your WordPress account is allowed to do, and you can disconnect it at any time from the AI agents (MCP) settings."
msgstr "%1$s meminta untuk menggunakan %2$s di tapak ini sebagai %3$s. Ia hanya boleh melakukan perkara yang dibenarkan untuk akaun WordPress anda, dan anda boleh memutuskan sambungannya pada bila-bila masa daripada tetapan ejen AI (MCP)."

#. translators: 1: the AI app's name, 2: a domain name.
#: includes/mcp-kit/class-oauth.php:669
#, php-format
msgid "%1$s identified itself from %2$s."
msgstr "%1$s mengenal pasti dirinya dari %2$s."

#. translators: 1: the AI app's name, 2: a domain name.
#: includes/mcp-kit/class-oauth.php:672
#, php-format
msgid "%1$s registered itself automatically. Only continue if you started this from %2$s."
msgstr "%1$s telah mendaftarkan dirinya secara automatik. Hanya teruskan jika anda memulakan ini daripada %2$s."

#: includes/mcp-kit/class-oauth.php:676
msgid "Your account cannot use these tools on this site. Ask an administrator."
msgstr "Akaun anda tidak boleh menggunakan alatan ini di tapak web ini. Tanya pentadbir."

#. translators: %s: a domain name.
#: includes/mcp-kit/class-oauth.php:679
#, php-format
msgid "After you answer you will go back to %s."
msgstr "Selepas anda menjawab, anda akan kembali ke %s."

#. translators: %s: the AI app's name.
#: includes/mcp-kit/class-oauth.php:684
#, php-format
msgid "Allow %s"
msgstr "Benarkan %s"

#: includes/mcp-kit/class-oauth.php:685
msgid "Do not allow"
msgstr "Jangan benarkan"

#: includes/mcp-kit/class-rest-bridge.php:322
msgid "A required value is missing or has the wrong form. Check the ability's input schema."
msgstr "Nilai yang diperlukan tiada atau mempunyai format yang salah. Semak skema input (input schema) keupayaan tersebut."

#: includes/mcp-kit/class-rest-bridge.php:355
msgid "The site refused the request."
msgstr "Tapak menolak permintaan tersebut."

#: includes/mcp-kit/class-server.php:238
msgid "Let AI assistants such as Claude, Cursor or VS Code work on this site for you through MCP (Model Context Protocol). They sign in as a WordPress user (Claude and ChatGPT by approving them here, others with an application password) and can do only what that user is allowed to do."
msgstr "Benarkan pembantu AI seperti Claude, Cursor atau VS Code bekerja di laman ini untuk anda melalui MCP (Model Context Protocol). Mereka log masuk sebagai pengguna WordPress (Claude dan ChatGPT dengan meluluskannya di sini, yang lain dengan kata laluan aplikasi) dan hanya boleh melakukan perkara yang dibenarkan untuk pengguna tersebut."

#: includes/mcp-kit/class-server.php:240
msgid "AI agents need WordPress 6.9 or later. Update WordPress to use them."
msgstr "Ejen AI memerlukan WordPress 6.9 atau lebih baharu. Kemas kini WordPress untuk menggunakannya."

#: includes/mcp-kit/class-server.php:253
msgid "Connection address (MCP endpoint)"
msgstr "Alamat sambungan (titik akhir MCP)"

#: includes/mcp-kit/class-server.php:257
msgid "Claude and ChatGPT: sign in instead"
msgstr "Claude dan ChatGPT: log masuk sebagai ganti"

#: includes/mcp-kit/class-server.php:258
msgid "Add the connection address as a custom connector in Claude, or as an app in ChatGPT developer mode. They open this site so you can approve them; no password to copy."
msgstr "Tambah alamat sambungan sebagai penyambung tersuai dalam Claude, atau sebagai aplikasi dalam mod pembangun ChatGPT. Mereka membuka laman ini supaya anda boleh meluluskannya; tiada kata laluan untuk disalin."

#: includes/mcp-kit/class-server.php:260
msgid "AI apps connected to your account:"
msgstr "Aplikasi AI yang disambungkan ke akaun anda:"

#: includes/mcp-kit/class-server.php:269
msgid "Disconnect"
msgstr "Putuskan sambungan"

#: includes/mcp-kit/class-server.php:275
msgid "Other AI apps: an application password"
msgstr "Aplikasi AI lain: kata laluan aplikasi"

#: includes/mcp-kit/class-server.php:277
msgid "Create an application password for your user"
msgstr "Cipta kata laluan aplikasi untuk pengguna anda"

#: includes/mcp-kit/class-server.php:278
msgid "Add this to your AI app’s MCP settings, with your username and that password:"
msgstr "Tambah ini ke tetapan MCP aplikasi AI anda, dengan nama pengguna dan kata laluan tersebut:"

#: includes/mcp-kit/class-server.php:280
msgid "VS Code: put the same entry under \"servers\" in .vscode/mcp.json, not under \"mcpServers\"."
msgstr "VS Code: letakkan entri yang sama di bawah \"servers\" dalam .vscode/mcp.json, bukan di bawah \"mcpServers\"."

#. translators: %d: how many tools an AI agent can use.
#: includes/mcp-kit/class-server.php:284
#, php-format
msgid "Tools an AI agent can use here (%d):"
msgstr "Alat yang boleh digunakan oleh ejen AI di sini (%d):"

#: includes/mcp-kit/class-server.php:295
msgid "User guide: AI agents and MCP"
msgstr "Panduan pengguna: Ejen AI dan MCP"

#: includes/mcp-kit/class-server.php:298
msgid "Developer docs: abilities, REST and MCP"
msgstr "Dokumen pembangun: keupayaan, REST dan MCP"

#: includes/mcp/class-abilities.php:54
msgid "Manage your hosting clients, their plans and their sites on Zinn Digital® from this site."
msgstr "Urus pelanggan pengehosan anda, pelan mereka dan tapak web mereka di Zinn Digital® daripada tapak web ini."

#: includes/mcp/class-abilities.php:60
msgid "Your clients, their plans and their sites, through your Zinn Digital® reseller account."
msgstr "Pelanggan anda, pelan mereka dan laman mereka, melalui akaun penjual semula Zinn Digital® anda."

#: includes/mcp/class-abilities.php:108
msgid "Read your reseller account"
msgstr "Baca akaun penjual semula anda"

#: includes/mcp/class-abilities.php:109
msgid "Returns your reseller account in one read: brand, plans, clients and services counts, and what is set up."
msgstr "Mengembalikan akaun penjual semula anda dalam satu bacaan: jenama, pelan, bilangan pelanggan dan perkhidmatan, serta apa yang telah disediakan."

#: includes/mcp/class-abilities.php:115
msgid "List your clients"
msgstr "Senaraikan klien anda"

#: includes/mcp/class-abilities.php:116
msgid "Lists your client accounts, a page at a time (cursor, limit)."
msgstr "Menyenaraikan akaun pelanggan anda, satu halaman pada satu masa (cursor, limit)."

#: includes/mcp/class-abilities.php:122
msgid "Create a client"
msgstr "Cipta klien"

#: includes/mcp/class-abilities.php:123
msgid "Creates a client account under yours (name; default_currency, a three-letter code). Put them on a plan before their first site."
msgstr "Mencipta akaun pelanggan di bawah akaun anda (name; default_currency, kod tiga huruf). Masukkan mereka ke dalam pelan sebelum laman pertama mereka."

#: includes/mcp/class-abilities.php:142
msgid "Read a client's plan"
msgstr "Baca pelan pelanggan"

#: includes/mcp/class-abilities.php:143
msgid "Returns which plan a client is on and what it costs you (client_id)."
msgstr "Mengembalikan pelan yang dilanggan oleh pelanggan dan kos yang perlu anda tanggung (client_id)."

#: includes/mcp/class-abilities.php:149
msgid "Put a client on a plan"
msgstr "Tetapkan pelan kepada pelanggan"

#: includes/mcp/class-abilities.php:150
msgid "Puts a client on one of your plans (client_id, plan_code; interval: month or year). Do this before their first site."
msgstr "Meletakkan pelanggan pada salah satu pelan anda (client_id, plan_code; interval: month atau year). Lakukan ini sebelum tapak pertama mereka."

#: includes/mcp/class-abilities.php:172
msgid "List the plans you can sell"
msgstr "Senaraikan pelan yang boleh anda jual"

#: includes/mcp/class-abilities.php:173
msgid "Lists the hosting plans and their prices (product_line and currency narrow it)."
msgstr "Menyenaraikan pelan pengehosan dan harganya (product_line dan currency mengecilkannya)."

#: includes/mcp/class-abilities.php:187
msgid "List your clients' sites"
msgstr "Senaraikan laman pelanggan anda"

#: includes/mcp/class-abilities.php:188
msgid "Lists everything you have provisioned for your clients (client_id and status narrow it), a page at a time."
msgstr "Menyenaraikan semua yang telah anda sediakan untuk pelanggan anda (client_id dan status mengecilkannya), satu halaman pada satu masa."

#: includes/mcp/class-abilities.php:199
msgid "Create a site for a client"
msgstr "Cipta tapak untuk pelanggan"

#: includes/mcp/class-abilities.php:200
msgid "Creates a hosted site for one of your clients (client_id, product_line, primary_domain). It is billed to your account at the client's plan, as from your shop."
msgstr "Mencipta tapak dihoskan untuk salah seorang pelanggan anda (client_id, product_line, primary_domain). Ia dibilkan ke akaun anda pada pelan pelanggan, seperti dari kedai anda."

#: includes/mcp/class-abilities.php:220
msgid "Suspend a client's site"
msgstr "Gantung laman klien"

#: includes/mcp/class-abilities.php:221
msgid "Puts a client's site on a non-payment hold (site_id; reason: your own note, never shown to the client). The site stops serving until it is unsuspended."
msgstr "Menangguhkan tapak pelanggan atas sebab tiada pembayaran (site_id; reason: nota anda sendiri, tidak pernah ditunjukkan kepada pelanggan). Tapak berhenti berfungsi sehingga ia dinyahsuspensi."

#: includes/mcp/class-abilities.php:239
msgid "Unsuspend a client's site"
msgstr "Nyahgantung tapak pelanggan"

#: includes/mcp/class-abilities.php:240
msgid "Lifts a non-payment hold, so the site serves again (site_id)."
msgstr "Mengangkat sekatan bukan pembayaran, supaya laman berfungsi semula (site_id)."

#: includes/mcp/class-abilities.php:249
msgid "Read the Reseller Toolkit settings"
msgstr "Baca tetapan Toolkit Penjual Semula"

#: includes/mcp/class-abilities.php:250
msgid "Returns this plugin's settings (the API address, the plan new orders use, which features are on). The API key is never returned, only whether one is saved."
msgstr "Mengembalikan tetapan pemalam ini (alamat API, pelan yang digunakan pesanan baharu, ciri yang diaktifkan). Kunci API tidak sekali-kali dikembalikan, hanya maklumat sama ada ia disimpan."

#: includes/mcp/class-abilities.php:256
msgid "Change the Reseller Toolkit settings"
msgstr "Ubah tetapan Reseller Toolkit"

#: includes/mcp/class-abilities.php:257
msgid "Changes the settings you send (plan_code, enable_domain_search, enable_panel_link, enable_woocommerce) and keeps the rest. The API key and address are changed on the screen only."
msgstr "Mengubah tetapan yang anda hantar (plan_code, enable_domain_search, enable_panel_link, enable_woocommerce) dan mengekalkan yang lain. Kunci API dan alamat hanya ditukar pada skrin sahaja."

#: includes/mcp/class-abilities.php:306
msgid "Add your Zinn Digital® reseller API key on the Reseller Toolkit screen first."
msgstr "Sila tambah kunci API penjual semula Zinn Digital® anda pada skrin Reseller Toolkit terlebih dahulu."
